    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "It seems that Zubayr broke the window... and left on his own?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "I'll go find him and bring him back."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Leave it to the museum, Pepe. You haven't had a proper rest for several days now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "The envoy from the City of Gold is about to reach my father's territory, Anat. I need every second I can get."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Pepe..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "You and Titi have gone through a lot tidying up the damage to the museum. I suspect there are a few spots Zubayr might be. I'll go check them out right away."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Do you know why I didn't want to lend you Zubayr at first, Pepe? After I got your letter saying you were coming back, I wanted to tell you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Two months ago, I was on a business trip in your father's domain. There, I saw that the envoy from the City of Gold had already arrived."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Your brother's already gone to the City."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "You knew, but you never told me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "You were so happy in your letter telling me what you found. You even used twenty exclamation marks in a row at one point."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#10$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "I... I didn't have the heart to tell you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Then why'd you lend him to me? You got me excited over nothing..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "This is a city of jewels, Pepe! There's just so many gems here that I thought you'd never find the ones you were looking for!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "I thought you might give up on your own, when the time came."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "B-But the envoy was supposed to arrive in August, right? Why were they ahead of schedule?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Your father wrote a letter requesting they come in advance."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "So they already decided a long time ago. They just didn't want me to kick up a fuss, so they waited until I was out looking for artifacts of the Shah before sending the kid off to the City of Gold."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#9$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "But He told me he would wait to see my discovery before making his decision..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "The elders always make their own decisions, Pepe. Nothing us can do about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Did you see the brat too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "...Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "He must be real happy with himself, getting to go to the City of Gold. I don't know how many times we've fought in public <i>or</i> in private."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "I don't think he was particularly happy about it, Pepe. From what I could see, he looked like he's been hiding some sadness this whole time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "He called me to the study that day, saying that it was unlikely the two of you would meet again in your lifetimes, and that he hoped that I could pass a few words on to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "What did he say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "He said he hopes you will remember his voice. After that, he left."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "He didn't have much luggage on him, and only a portion of it was his. Everything else had to do with you and your father."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Pepe...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Ever since I was little, everyone would tell me how becoming the Shahanshah's historian would continue my family's honorable legacy. But honor is usually bought with sacrifice and devotion, Anat."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Entering the City of Gold and becoming the historian means never leaving ever again, never to see your friends or family. All that comes with you is your scrolls and books."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "But... you really hate being chained to a desk, don't you, Pepe?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Yep. I wanted to spend my entire life walking across Sargon, free to look for every remnant and vestige left behind by history."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "But I couldn't do all that... because I couldn't let the boy get what he wanted."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Is it so tough for you to let your brother get his way that you'd rather be unhappy yourself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Ever since we were little, everyone who saw him would praise him as a quiet yet cool-headed boy, perfect historian material."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "I was the only one who knew how bad he was, and that he loved fooling around. Making him sit in front of a table for more than a second was torture for him."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "Then why did the two of you fight over the position of court historian?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "Because he didn't want me to go to the City of Gold."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "He didn't want me stuck there by myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anat",
        "text": "So you...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "I'm kinda the same..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pepe",
        "text": "I don't want him to be stuck there by himself either."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
