    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr",
        "text": "A gem that would bring relief to sore legs after standing for too long? No, I have no need of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_jewelryimpact",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr",
        "text": "A gem that would cause the other party to apologize of their own accord? Of some use, but also not what I seek."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr",
        "text": "I can sense that the gem is extremely close, but there are far, far too many jewels in this house..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
