    {
        "text": "Hearing footsteps coming from the corridor, Zubayr immediately hurries back to the huge gilded box to lie down."
    },
    {
        "text": "He senses an attentive gaze falling upon him, yet not a word breaks the silence. He cautiously opens his eyes a silver\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "And sees a sand-colored animal."
    },
